   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "1994-02-02",
   "text": "Davis-Bacon Abolition Act - Repeals the Davis-Bacon Act (an Act which requires that the locally prevailing wage rate be paid to various classes of laborers and mechanics working under federally-financed or federally-assisted contracts for construction, alteration, and repair of public buildings or public works)."
